# Karon design (tokens)

Canonical: `DESIGN.md`, `docs/design-system.md`, `packages/design-system/src/styles/tokens.css`. Skill: `.cursor/skills/karon-design/`.

- Import chrome from `@karon/design-system`. Do not `shadcn add` into an app.
- Semantic classes only: `bg-background`, `bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`. Raw palette (`bg-sky-500`, hex in className) is a bug. Light/dark comes from `data-theme`, not from `dark:bg-*` in features.
- Clinic: `data-density="clinic"`, tap ≥ 44px. One primary per section. Sentence case.
- Status = label + role color. Green is paid/synced, not the default button and not owner totals.
- Offline is information, not an error. Reminders: clinic + time only (NFR-14).
